Protype Slicer engine source
============================

This tree is the source of the Protype Slicer engine: the program
protype-slicer-daemon and the Rust crates in crates/. The exact revision is in
the file REVISION; the source of a release is the tag slicer-vX.Y.Z of
https://github.com/dinamicby/protype-slicer-engine.


